SUMMARY:Mobile in the Gilded Age exhibition at the History Museum of Mobil
 e
DESCRIPTION:The History Museum of Mobile opened Mobile in the Gilded Age o
 n October 9\, 2026\, and the exhibition stays up through June 6\, 2027. G
 owns\, inventions and everyday objects show how railroads\, new technolog
 y and department stores changed life in Mobile in the late 1800s and earl
 y 1900s. The exhibition also covers the unequal opportunities and segrega
 tion of the period.\nPrice: from $8\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin County\nTimes
